    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brendan Kearns, Hills Property, is pleased to present this two-residence estate consisting of one detached bungalow (F93 CX46) and one derelict semi-detached property (F93 AE3E) in Raphoe, Co. Donegal.  The preferred option is to sell both properties together.  Both properties are listed on www.daft.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The property contains three double bedrooms, one large bathroom, kitchen/dining room, sitting room & laundry room. \r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nHallway: 19m2.  Laminate floor, radiator\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 4.2m x 4.2m.  Laminate floor, radiator, front & side windows, open fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room:  4.2m x 3.3m.  Tiled floor, radiator, rear & side windows, upper & lower built in units, electric oven/hob/extractor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:  3.3m x 3.3m.  Laminate floor, front window, radiator\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  4.2m x 3.3m.  Laminate floor, front window, radiator\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:  3.7m x 3.3m.  Laminate floor, rear & side windows, radiator\r\n\r\nLaundry room: 1.9m x 1m.  Tiled floor, rear window, radiator\r\n\r\nBathroom:  3.3m x 2.7m.  Tiled floor, floor-ceiling wall tiles, radiator, heated towel rail, rear windows, WC, walk in shower, hand basin\r\n\r\nThe second property is a semi-detached 1 bed bungalow measuring approximately 36m2.\r\nThat property is on the market for €95,000 and can be found at:\r\n(https://www.daft.ie/for-sale/magheraboy-raphoe-lifford-co-donegal/6596767)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The properties face South East on to the Oakfield Demense.  A tar & chip driveway provides ample parking for both properties.  A garden to the left could potentially facilitate separate access for each property, however the current configuration works very well in this spacious site.\r\n\r\nThe site measures approximately 0.6 acres, which includes a large rectangular garden area measuring approximately 0.3 acres / 1200m2 / 73m x 17.5m.  It also contains a stand alone block built shed with power and light, measuring approximately 24m2.\r\n\r\nThis property is a detached 3 bed bungalow measuring approximately 100m2.\r\nIt has been vacant for over 2 years, making it eligible for grant aid under the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, (up to €70,000 to help buyers and owners turn vacant or derelict properties into their permanent home or rental property)."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
